<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus da Ase ko Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ase ko Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ogl</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ko Ogalatiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Okpa mani bwebe hin Obulus, ni oshoshu hin ko wo oyikoko ko Oyesu bwebe ka asuse lalo, ke bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi abiyinu la, kpo Owuso Ada, ni yo Oyesu nyiso bwi ikwu ni. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Ayene kpiri ni bebeni kpa ami ni ba toleho ko gbogba ga awoda ko Owuso ni bo Ogalatiya ni.<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Owuso Ada kaha kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi na dala oneshi kpo omene.<verse eid="GAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Oyesu Okristi wa gekwu ikweyi kozalabi kaha, shini ona ngmaha sho oyi bibi mani. Oya mani byoni Owuso Ada kaha ya yimu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Igyashi wa ko Owuso ko gbogbo-gbogbo! Nalemani.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oshu Neshi Woye Kpokponu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Igbashi kwun kotata koni ipu kishi gbayayi ala ba yimu ko shase ni yala ogwu bwebe ko oneshi ko Okristi ni bita, kweyi ba kyogwu kposhu neshi oye hoha. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Kokwokwoshi, oshu neshi oye hoha yaba lo. Nke ka mani ikweyi koni agbawase ni ba gyalegya, kweyi ba takirikwu ko yo oshu neshi ko Okristi yi pya ni. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Owoni aha kwe oyoleho oye bwi iso wa tono koshu neshi oye gogo kpo olamu ni aha ka dala ni, ona gole kola! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Byoni aha kwobonu ka dala ni, nki ya ka dala anani mo: owoni ashe tono koshu neshi oye gogo kpo olamu ni ala kwobonu ze ni, ona gole kola!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Ala ba ma mo nyya kela mani shase na kyogwu kpela hin la? Aayi! Owuso pini nyya yimu shona kyogwu kpami la. Ala ba ma byo nyya yimu ko shase otu la? Aayi! Owoni nbi tayayo ya yimu ko shase otu nbi ya wo oyole ko Okristi lo.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owuso yo Obulus Ogwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Nyya yimu shala gye ayene hin, oshu neshi ni nyya tono mani bwebe kasuse la lo. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Nnye bwebe ka asuse la lo, ashishe ke fun lo. Oyesu Okristi abiyinu pini sayi anu dami la.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Ala pwoza ni nyya ka ishini nyya ko owe kawo Oyahuda ni, nyya dase ko Owuso egye ki ya takirikwu ko yuwa kya. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Nko owe ko Oyahuda shawase ni anyiso dudu ni, nziyun do odu kawokyikyi kaha shananoho.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Owuso ipu koneshi nu ke shun ome amun la, oyumogwu ko yoko danu. Ishini shotu ni <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />osayi Oyi nu dami, shini na tono ko oshu neshi dawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, nkpela shashishe ko tumoko lo. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Nke go Ojerusele ebe kawase ni kwobonu dami ipu kayikoko ko Oyesu ni lo. Ozani nyya ni ebebeni nggagye ka Arabiya, bwebe ni nkwikye wo Odamasko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Itikpi kishayi eta ome nggo Ojerusele ga mo Okefas ni wo Osimo Obitrus ni. Nyyo obize epa kpanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Itikpi koni nmo oyikoko ko Oyesu oyoye ke lo, Oyakubu ni woyene ka Adole ni fufunu pini nmo la. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Ozani nta dala mani wokwokwoshi, Owuso gye mo nyya kokame lalo!<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Itikpi koni nggebe shishini agye ko Osiriya kpo Okilikiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Ishi oni awase kawoda ko Owuso ni bo Oyahudiya ni gyun lo. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Aba pwoza ni ase shishini ba ka ni kin la mo: &lt;&lt;Ongo ni ya daha egye ni, anani anu abiyinu ya tono kotuse ni ishi oye oya takirikwu ko yi yishi ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Mani oni asho Owuso iye ikweyi hin.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Ashini ka Ayikoko ko Yesu Nyo Obulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Itikpi ki ishayi igwene nki kwikye go Ojerusele kpo Obarnabas kpo Otitus. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Ngga ikweyi koni Owuso sayi dami mo na ga ni. Ni ngga ni ngbayi kpa anyakwase kole ko Owuso, nka dawa owe ni nyya tono koshu neshi dawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni. Nkela mani dawa fufuwa okoka shini oko hin ni nyya ga kponi nyya ya anani mani naka woyeye lo. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Otitus oya kiyawu hin, koni owase ko Ogirik ni, ashishe kwo koshu ko shofu lo, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />koni ashini wa yimu shini ona shofu ni, awase mani pa gipu kikpo kaha ko wa gyotu ka, aba ya byo awawo kyogwu kpo Okristi oni, shini ana wa gyotu kominyo ni apye bwebe kema kaha kpo Okristi Oyesu ni, aba yimu ko yaha shan wo oshe, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />aha ke kyuwogwu lo kpiri-kpiri, shini okwokwoshi koshu neshi na yo kpala.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Ase ni ke lema bya awoteyi ni, nyya ka mani ikweyi koni oza ni awe ni shiwo hin lo; Owuso ya mase bwebe komoma kiyi lalo, awoteyi oni woje pepe ebe hin lo. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Abishi koni, ama ni Owuso damoko ko tono koshu neshi dofu afafu, byoni odo Obitrus oko ko tono koshu neshi dawase ni shofu ni. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Owuso oyun woyikoko bwebe koshu nu gebe kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, byoni oyo Obitrus woyikoko gebe kase ko Oyahuda ni. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Oyakubu, Obitrus kpo Oyohana, ni lema byawi ite ni, gye mo Owuso pini damoko nyakwu mani la; mani oni adami kpo Obarnabas abo, oni sayi maha kpiri wawoya koko neshi la. Akyogwu kpiyi kaha mami kpo Obarnabas ba yoko ipu kawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, awa ke ba yoko ipu kase ko Oyahuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Amo ahan bi rela ka awoleha ni bipu wa ni, oza ni adoka ni kin oma, oza ni nke ya showu koyoya ni.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Gbo Obitrus Apwo Ogya ka Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ishini Obitrus ke wa Antakiya ni ngbapwo iyi kananoho, ikweyi koni ananoho gye mo oyoza gyogye lo. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Ome awase no Oyakubu tuwoleho ni na webe ni, oyagye ya roza kpawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu ni. Ni ango mani ke wa ni, Obitrus sha gitikpi kweyi shozarore bita, ikweyi koni oya yoshi kawase ni ba yela kofu shoshe ni. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Mamani ashini ka Ase ko Oyahuda ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu ni kwotu ko yoza byawo yoziyi dudu kpo Obitrus; Obarnabas gbo gipu ko yoziyi kpawa mamani. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Ni nma mowe koza yoya wa ga gyogye kpo okwokwoshi koshu neshi lo ni, nka do Obitrus obutu wa kpiri mo, &lt;&lt;Owase ko Oyahuda la, oke ya yoza byase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni. Bwowe wonya noya takirikwu ko yawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni na yoko kpo odu kase ko Oyahuda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angmase Kpiri Bwebe Kotuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Kokwokwoshi, aha womoma ko Oyahuda la, aha wase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni aba yuwogwu mo awinozalabi ni lalo. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Kwikyikyeni agye mase ya wase neshi bwebe ko kyogwu kpo Oyesu Okristi kin la, bwebe ko ko Ono lalo. Mani oni, aha kyogwu kpo Okristi Oyesu shini ana yaha wase neshi bwebe kotuse kaha ipu ko Okristi, wa ko ko Ono lalo. Koni ashishe ya wase neshi bwebe ko ko Ono lo. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Owoni ake ba takirikwu ko wase neshi ebe ko Owuso bwebe kema kaha kpo Okristi, aki maha wa awinozalabi byawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, olema byo Okristi ya yoko ko yozalabi na gohobu ona? Olemani lalo! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Owoni nkyo oko ko Ono ni nyyi kye ni ma, nsayi kiyun mun wino yo Ono kigbo oma. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Mani oni ebe ko Ono, nkwobonu gekwu wa, Ono abiyinu yun ngmo, shini na yiyi do Owuso. Akwobonu yun ngmo kpo Okristi ni ayo poshi ni, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />mani oni ami pini yiyi ke lalo, Okristi pini yiyi ipu hin la. Oyiyi hin anani, nyyiyi bwebe ko totuso Oyi ko Owuso ni yimu hin kweyi gekwu ikweyi hin ni. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Nta hin ko tela koneshi ko Owuso. Owoni asuse ke ya wase neshi ebe ko Owuso bwebe ko Ono, oya lema byikwu ko Okristi woyeye oma!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Ono Kwe Otuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Awikyo ko Ogalatiya! Anoho yalotu gbo? Iyiyi kala kyaa asayi ko Oyesu Okristi ni ayo poshi ni. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Na daloka koje oye kpokponu: ala pyo Omaku ko Owuso ikweyi koni ala ba ko Ono ni la, kwe ala pye bwebe ko pwoshu neshi kweyi kyogwu kpanu? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Oji yala wikyo mani! Ala kwotu kpo Omaku ko Owuso; anani ala ba yimu ko ngmeyi kpikpiye? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Ala mowe kotata mani yeye kin la? Oke wo yeye lalo! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ala ba ma mo Owuso dala Omaku nu kweyi ki yawoza kigbashi ipu kala koni ala ba ko Ono ni la, kwe koni ala pwoshu neshi kweyi kyogwu kpanu ni?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Ala rela ki Ibirayi; byoni Okpa ka ni, &lt;&lt;Okyogwu kpo Owuso, kweyi bwebe ko kyogwu nu Owuso zo waseneshi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Nyya yimu shala gye mawase ni kyogwu ni pini wayi ki Ibirayi kokwokwoshi la. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Okpa kamo Owuso ya yawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni ba wase neshi ebe nu bwebe kotuse wa. Mani oni Okpa tono ko Oshu Neshi mani di Ibirayi mo: &lt;&lt;Owuso ya dasuse kpiri aboneshi bwebe wo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Ibirayi kyogwu kweyi opya aboneshi; mani oni kpiri kase ni kyogwu aba pya aboneshi mamani. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Kpiri kase ni ba totuso Ono ko kanu akwobonu yuwokwunu. Koni Okpa kamo, &lt;&lt;Kpiri kase ni geyagye dojoji ni yipu ko Ono ni ishi kpiri lo Owuso yokwunu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Ni olemani oni oyo kyaa mashishe ya gege ya wase neshi ebe ko Owuso bwebe ko Ono lo, ikweyi koni Okpa kamo, &lt;&lt;Ase neshi ya gbolayi bwebe kotuse la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Ono ke gbabo kpotuse lo; abishi koni, byoni Okpa ka ni, &lt;&lt;Kpiri kase ni yoza kpiri no Ono ya yimu ni oya yiyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Okristi ke ngmaha shokwunu yoya no Ono biwa ni bwebe ko wase ni ayokwunu ni abishi kaha: Okpa kamo, &lt;&lt;Kpiri kase ni ayo poshi owase ni ayokwunu ni la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Okristi ya mani shini ana da awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni aboneshi no Owuso shokoyi di Ibirayi ni bwebe ko Okristi Oyesu, shini ahan nyo Omaku ko Owuso ni oshokoyi ni bwebe kotuse.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ono Kpo Okoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Ayene hin, nyya shaloje ni ya gbodagye kurutu ni: ishini ase epa kyogwu ikweyi koza kweyi tabo okoyi, ashishe ya yi kyigbo lo ake ba foje manu lo. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Anani, Owuso shokoyi di Ibirayi kpoyi kipwoma nu. Okpa kamo odi Ibirayi kpa ayi kipwoma nu la lo, obi lemani obi ya wase nwashika, oke kamo oyi ki ipwoma nu la, ase oye kpokponu, ni wo Okristi ni. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Ozani nyya yimu shini ala gye ni Owuso shokoyi di Ibirayi kweyi kyogwu ko yo na gbodagye. Ono mani, nayi kwagye itikpi kishayi ogbogbo ene saweta ni, ya gege ya yokoyi ko Owuso kyigbo lo, oke ya yokoyi ko Owuso bya lo. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Owoni eshi ko Owuso bi ya bwebe ko Ono la, obi ya bwebe kokoyi nu kelo. Oke bwebe kokoyi pini Owuso zeshi oni di Ibirayi la. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Owoni olemani, oko ko Ono woji? Abyono wa manu shini an gyoza ni wo ozalabi ni la, shana yoko kpanu gbishini Oyi kipwoma ki Ibirayi oni na wa, anu na shokoyi danu ni. Ono mani ke bwabo ka ayoleho ko Owuso la, kpase ni ya gobepa kase epa ni. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Ino gobepa ke ya gege ya gobepa kase oye kpokponu lo; Owuso ke woye la.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oko ko Ono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Omani ya ka daha mo Ono wo omonyekwotu ko okoyi ko Owuso la? Aayi, olemani lalo! Owoni adasuse ono ni ya dase olayi ni, ananoho bi ya wase neshi ebe ko Owuso bwebe ko geyagye do Ono. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Okpa kamo ese kpiri bo oruduru ko ozalabi; mani oni eshi na shokoyi bwebe kotuse ipu ko Oyesu Okristi ni, wa kawase ni kyogwu kpo Oyesu ni.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Ome ishi kotuse na wa, ono yaha yi gbo byase ni ayuwa shetu ni gbishini aba sayi kotuse ni yawa ni. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Mani oni aha babo ko Ono gbishini Okristi wa, shini ana yaha wase neshi ebe ko Owuso bwebe kotuse. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Nabani nishi kotuse kwobonu wa ni, aha babo ko Ono kelo.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Kpiri kala wayi ko Owuso dudu kpo Okristi Oyesu, bwebe kotuse. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Ayala obatisma dudu kpo Okristi, anani ala abiyikala shoshiye ko olayi ko Okristi. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Ni olemani oni kase ko Oyahuda kase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, koshe kase ni yabo kiyinu, kanya kango; kpiri kala woye kponu ipu kema kpo Okristi Oyesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Owoni owa ko Okristi, owo oyi kipwoma ki Ibirayi oma, kweyi owino rogwu koza ni Owuso shokoyi ni.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ozani nyya kani yoma, owoni ino rogwu woyi leke, ogogo kpo oshe lo, koni owine kojoji kpiri ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Oya yabo kawase ni ba byo ni gishi ni adanu shu ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Mamani, ishini awayi lekeke ni, awo oshe kawomaku ni ba kpogwu kese mani. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ni ishi ke gye ni, Owuso to Oyi nu oleho. Omoma konya, ni amo ipu ko Ono ni, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />shini na ngmase ni babo ko Ono ni, shini ahan wayi ko Owuso.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Ko sayi mala wayi, Owuso toleho kpo Omaku ko Oyi nu wipu ko otu kala, ya yogwu mo &lt;&lt;Ada, Ada hin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Mani oni owo oshe kelo, owoyi la. Koni owoyi nu ni, Owuso ya dawojoji ni ogbo ko dayi nu ni.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Dotose kase ko Ogalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Nekye-nekye ala gyo Owuso lo, oni yala ba gbeshe dawoza ni wowuso lo ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Anani ke ala gyo Owuso, kwe na mo anani Owuso gyala, ojiya nala ba yimu ko kwikye gipu kodu kese mani ni woza kiyinyinyi kweyi gboshu kojije lo ni? Ala ba yimu ko wo oshe ipu nu kwikikyeni? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Ala ba ko ono kaweno, kpo awoya, kpa awishi, kpa awishayi! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ozani ala baya mani ya tumoshi! Oko ni nyya kpala kpiri ni woyeye ona? <verse eid="GAL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Nyya bala ayene ala lema byami, koni nlema byala la. Ala yotu hin bya lo. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ala gye mo ere ni gboni, pini gwowe ko oshu neshi kikyikyo dala la. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Koni ere hin malama ni, ala tela hin lo, ala byun neneshi. Ala zun byo oyoleho ko Owuso ni bwi iso, byun wo Okristi Oyesu abiyinu oni. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Ishi oni ala shotunehe! Anani oji to otunehe kala? Ami abiyun gye kamo owoni ala bi ba gege la, ala biba yikpiyi kala ngma dami! <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Anani nwwo omonyekwotu kala ikweyi ko kwokwoshi ni nka dala ni ona?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Awani ba takirikwu ko yala otu kwu, otu wa ke shoshi lo. Ozani aba yimu ni wako ngmala shipu kaha, shini ala yotu kala dawa byoni ayotu wa dala ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Oshoshi ko yotu kala dawa, owoni owa koneshi, omani wokwokwoshi ishi kpiri, wishi ni nyyo kpala ni kin lalo. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Ayi hin moshi! Anani otu ki ya dumose byonya ni kwagye koma ni, nyya dose mamani dala gbishini aba mo Okristi ipu kala. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Abi mun yo kpala pi yoma, oko hin bi ya pya, ikweyi koni nyya byotu ikweyi kala kotata ni!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ohaga kpo Osera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Na dala oka, ala ni ba yimu ko ko Ono ni. Ala gyoza ni ono kani lo? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Ayitota mo Ibirayi mayi epa, oye bwebe koshe nu, oye bwebe konya nu. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Oyi koshe amo byoni aba moyi ni kin la, oyi konya nu ke amo bwebe kokoyi ko Owuso la. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Oza mani ya sayi koje: anya epa mani hagye ikweyi ko okoyi epa. Ase ni mayi nu ipu koshe ni iyenu wo Haga, anu pini wokoyi ni ashe Efu ko Osinayi ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Ohaga ni we Efu ko Osinayi ni yo okpagye ka Arabiya ni, anu pini wo Ojerusele kanani la, kanu kase nu kpiri bipu ko gbeshe. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ojerusele ni yiso ni ke wo oshe la lo, anu pini wene kaha la. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Koni ayitota mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">&lt;&lt;Shotunehe, awo odoma, awo ni moyi lo ni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Sheha kotunehe, awo ni gyo dose koma lo ni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Ikweyi koni onya ni oba shobita ni ya mayi nwashika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">shase ni yo kpo obunu ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Anani ayene hin, aha wayi ko Owuso bwebe kokoyi nu, byoni Ishaku we ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ishi oni oyi ni womoma kikpiye ni ya doyi ni womoma ko Omaku ko Owuso ni egye; Kwikyikyeni olemani. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ake yi tota ipu ko Okpa ko Owuso mo, &lt;&lt;Noshe mani kpo oyinu ena, koni oyi koshe mani ya rogwu kpo oyi konya kotata mani lo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ni olemani oni ayene hin, aha wayi konya ni wo oshe ni la lo, ake wayi konya kotata la.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Agboshu ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Oshu ni agbo ni wo Okristi ni ngmaha ni! Ala hagye byase ni ayuwa ngma oko ni, ala ka shiyi kala bita byoshe kelo. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ala pwo! Ami Obulus pini ya kadala ma, owoni ala kyogwu mana shala ofu, olema byo Okristi gboko ipu kala lo kpiri-kpiri oma. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Nyya rala mo ase ni ya ko ono kofu shoshe, owotiri ko ko Ono kpiri oma. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ala ni ba yimu ko wase neshi obutu ko Owuso bwebe ko ko Ono ni, ala yiyikala ngma sho Okristi oma. Ala bose shipu keshi ko Owuso oma. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Aha ke, atotuse mo Owuso ya yaha wase neshi obutu nu; omani pini woza ni aha ba gbeyi bwebe koshu ko Omaku ko Owuso ni ya yoko ipu kotuse kaha ni. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Owoni abipu ko Okristi Oyesu, kaha shofu kaha shofu lo, owojije lo; oza ni shoshi ni ase na gege ko yotuso Okristi, ni ya yoko bwebe kimu ni. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Ala ba gohobu neneshi! Anoho wa walobi ko geyagye do okwokwoshi? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Egya ni aba gyala ni bwebe ko Owuso ni yala ogwu ni lalo. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Byoni aba ka ni, &lt;&lt;Oyisi gbayayi pini ya yikyoga ya nu la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Kwikyikyeni nyya rala mo ntotusala. Ema kaha kpa Adole yun yotusala mala ba zela oye gogo lo, kweyi ase ni gyalegya ni Owuso ya gbogagye.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ayene hin, owoni nyya tono kofu shoshe la, ojiya ni ase ba damowe? Owoni nbiya kamo owotiri ko shofu la onototu hin ikweyi kikwu ko Okristi ikweyi koshi biya woza yeye! <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Nbi ya yimu mawo tawashu oni bi ga yiyiwa bwu!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Ala ke, ayene hin, Owuso yala ogwu shini ala ka wo oshe lo. Ala ka yabo bo shini na woza ko yala yo ozalabi lo, ala ke yoko diyikala ipu kimu. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ono kpiri abyo wa ikweyi kela oye: &lt;&lt;Yimu kase byoni oya yimu kiyo ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Owoni ala ke ba rotu kiyi kala, ala gbera la lo, ala ba yiyikala ngmo.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olayi Bwebe ko Omaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Nyya kamo ala sho Omaku bita na kpala ogwu, owoni ala ya mani ala ba gbimu kikpiye lo. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Ikweyi koni oko ki ikpiye ya tela koko ko Omaku, oko Omaku ke ya gbayi kpa ki kpiye lo, pepa wa wo monyekwotu kiyiwa, omani ya shiyaha mo oya yoza ni oya yimu ko yani lo. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Owoni Omaku yo kpawo, ono gboshu oyoye ikweyi wo lo. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Oko kikpiye ya teba lo: ebaboba, obwa, ozayoya shushuku, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />geyagye deka, oloha rore, onu, afu yoya, otu yoya, yimu kiyo, awashu tota, ikpo koko <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />kpa anya yoya; inyi gwogwa, igiga kowu yoya, kpa ashini koza mani. Nyya pyala akpaha byoni nkwobonu pyala akpaha ni: awino yawoza mani ba rogwu ko obula ko Owuso lo.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ozani Omaku ke ya ma ni yoma: imu yoya, otunehe, omene, otuzoze, oneshi yoya, oza neshi, okwokwoshi, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />otumene, kpo yase kwiyinu; ono yikweyi kawoza mani lo. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Awase ni wa ko Okristi Oyesu ni kwobonu yikpiye wa kozalabi yi ngmo oshi kpoza kpiri ni ikpiye ya yimu ni. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Omaku pini daha olayi la; owotiri shini ona kpaha ogwu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />An ka zikweyi iso kwe an yotu kiyikaha na bya kwe an yafu kiyikaha lo.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Ala Zenu Kiyikala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Ayene, owoni akwashe ya yozalabi, ala ni bipu ko omaku ni, ala kwikye anu wikweyi ko owe. Ala ke gbera shini ala ka gbo omama lo. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Ala zenu kiyikala, bwowe mani pini ala ba ko ono ko Okristi gyogye la. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Owoni ashe yama manu woje, oke wojije lo, oya gyiyinu egya pini yoma. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Ananoho na miyinu ma ome na gwabotu kpoza ni oyaya ni, wa ko miyinu kpashe la lo, kpiyi nu la. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Ananoho na byiyo kiyinu.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Aseni afela ko Owuso, oshu ko dase ni foza ni oza neshi bwipu kodu nu koza kese mani.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Ala ka gyiyikala egya lo. Ashishe ya gege ya gwo Owuso otu lo. Oza ni otu ni anu pini oya kye la. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Ase ni toza ipu kikpiye, bwebe kikpiye oya kyikwu, aseni ke toza ipu ko Omaku, bwebe ko Omaku oya kyo olayi ko gbogbo-gbogbo. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Ni olemani oni ahan ka nwa ko yoza neshi lo. Ikweyi koni ishi yawa ba ni aba kyizire neshi ni, owoni ashoza neshi ko yoya bita lo. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ishini aha pyebe ko yoza, an yananoho oneshi, kayi ki ipwoma ko otuse na shoshe.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela ko Gwejeji kpo Ogbogba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Ala mikpo kenena nyakwu-nyakwu ni nta dala kpa abo hin mani! <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Awase ni ba yimu ko yala shofu koshu mani wawino zikweyi iso la, kweyi aba gwabotu kpoza komoma kiyi. Aba ya mani ikweyi koni aba yoshi ko megye do oshi ko Okristi ni. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kawase ni ashuwofu ni ba ko Ono gyogye lalo; aba yimu shini ana shala ofu shini ana gwabotu mala geyagye do odu kikpiye mani la. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ami ya gwabotu lo owoni owi ikweyi ko oshi ka Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi lalo; koni bwebe ko oshi nu, ese wokwu ebe hin, ami ki wokwu ebe kese. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ko shofu ko shofu lo owojije la lo; ela ni she ni wela ko womoma pepe. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Omene kpiyinyinyi na yo kpawase ni ba ko ono ki Izrayila mani ipu koyagye wa ni, kawa kawase ko Owuso kpiri!<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Ko gwejeji: ashishe naka yotu hin na fo lo, koni ngbenena ko Oyesu ikpiye hin.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Ayene hin, oneshi ka Adole Oyesu Okristi na yo kpala kpiri. Nalemani.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>